; Immersive Identification -- MCM preset include hook.
;
; MCM (ui_mcm.script) reads preset sections from ini_file("presets\includes.ltx").
; No base game / MCM file ships here, so we create it -- but with a WILDCARD
; include rather than our sections inline, so any other mod can drop its own
; presets_<mod>.ltx in this folder and coexist instead of clobbering this file
; (same convention the base game uses, e.g. #include "materials_*"). Our own
; presets live in presets_ii.ltx alongside this file.
#include "presets_*.ltx"
